### 10. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Corrupted DB file | WAL mode + `PRAGMA synchronous = NORMAL` prevents most corruption. Add a startup integrity check: `PRAGMA integrity_check` |
| Migration fails mid-way | Each file import is wrapped in its own transaction + try/catch. Partial migration is safe because `schema_migrations` tracks what ran |
| DB file gets large | At estimated data volumes (10K witness, 5K scores, 1K runs), the DB will be ~10-20MB. Trivial for SQLite |
| Frontend expects exact JSON shapes | All `load*` functions reconstruct the exact same object shapes, including `JSON.parse()` on JSON columns |
| better-sqlite3 native compilation fails | Add to package.json `optionalDependencies` with a fallback error message on import. The npm package has prebuilds for macOS arm64/x64, Linux, Windows |

